<title>UK: Banco ABN AMRO Brazil prices $50 mln one-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco ABN AMRO Brazil prices $50 mln one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following  zero coupon bond has been priced, lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett said on Friday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO ABN AMRO BRAZIL</p>
<p> AMT	  $50 MLN   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    04.AUG.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  93.373    PAY DATE    04.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.125     REOFFER    93.373    DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   LISTING    AMSTERDAM SALE LIMS US/GB/BR/NL</p>
<p> NOTES	YIELD IS 7.00 PERCENT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
